<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Brazen Resolve</ansi> mutation

An unshakable, almost foolish confidence saturates your being.
Insults and intimidation slide off you like rain, but your swaggering
self-assurance blinds you to danger.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Moderately reduced incoming conviction damage — taunts and
  intimidation are far less effective against you

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Moderately reduced perception — your confidence blinds you to
  threats you should notice

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
